"const sum = doubled.reduce((acc, x) => acc + x, 0)\n"
"\n"
"console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`)\n"
"console.log(`Sum of doubled: ${sum}`)\n"
"```"

#: src/getting-started/hello-world.md:72
