#: src/ui/overview.md:89
msgid "Perry UIs are built as a tree of widgets:"
msgstr "Perry UIはウィジェットのツリーとして構築されます:"

#: src/ui/overview.md:91
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"function runWidgetTree(): void {\n"
"    App({\n"
"        title: \"Layout Demo\",\n"
"        width: 400,\n"
