"    body: VStack(12, [\n"
"        TextArea(\"Enter multi-line text...\", (value: string) => "
"content.set(value)),\n"
"        Text(`Length: ${content.value.length}`),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"// demonstrates: TextArea for multi-line input\n"
"// docs: docs/src/ui/widgets.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: ios-simulator, web, wasm\n"
"\n"
"import { App, VStack, Text, TextArea, State } from \"perry/ui\"\n"
"\n"
"const content = State(\"\")\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"TextArea\",\n"
"    width: 500,\n"
"    height: 400,\n"
"    body: VStack(12, [\n"
"        TextArea(\"Enter multi-line text...\", (value: string) => "
"content.set(value)),\n"
"        Text(`Length: ${content.value.length}`),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:332
msgid "**Helpers:** `textareaSetString`."
msgstr "**ヘルパー:** `textareaSetString`。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:334 src/cli/perry-toml.md:111
msgid "Sections"
msgstr "セクション"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:336
msgid ""
"Group controls into labelled sections. Perry has no `Form()` widget — use a "
"`VStack` of `Section(title)`s and attach children via `widgetAddChild`."
msgstr ""
"コントロールをラベル付きのセクションにグループ化します。Perryには`Form()`ウィ"
"ジェットはありません — `Section(title)`の`VStack`を使用し、`widgetAddChild`経"
"由で子をアタッチします。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:339
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"// demonstrates: Section grouping with widgetAddChild (no Form widget in "
"Perry)\n"
"// docs: docs/src/ui/widgets.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: ios-simulator, web, wasm\n"
"\n"
"import {\n"
"    App,\n"
"    VStack,\n"
"    Section,\n"
"    TextField,\n"
"    Toggle,\n"
"    State,\n"
"    widgetAddChild,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\"\n"
"\n"
"const name = State(\"\")\n"
"const notifications = State(true)\n"
"\n"
"const personal = Section(\"Personal Info\")\n"
"widgetAddChild(personal, TextField(\"Name\", (value: string) => "
"name.set(value)))\n"
"\n"
"const settings = Section(\"Settings\")\n"
"widgetAddChild(\n"
"    settings,\n"
"    Toggle(\"Notifications\", (on: boolean) => notifications.set(on)),\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"Sections\",\n"
"    width: 500,\n"
"    height: 400,\n"
"    body: VStack(16, [personal, settings]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"// demonstrates: Section grouping with widgetAddChild (no Form widget in "
"Perry)\n"
"// docs: docs/src/ui/widgets.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: ios-simulator, web, wasm\n"
"\n"
"import {\n"
"    App,\n"
"    VStack,\n"
"    Section,\n"
"    TextField,\n"
"    Toggle,\n"
"    State,\n"
"    widgetAddChild,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\"\n"
"\n"
"const name = State(\"\")\n"
"const notifications = State(true)\n"
"\n"
"const personal = Section(\"Personal Info\")\n"
"widgetAddChild(personal, TextField(\"Name\", (value: string) => "
"name.set(value)))\n"
"\n"
"const settings = Section(\"Settings\")\n"
"widgetAddChild(\n"
"    settings,\n"
"    Toggle(\"Notifications\", (on: boolean) => notifications.set(on)),\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"Sections\",\n"
"    width: 500,\n"
"    height: 400,\n"
"    body: VStack(16, [personal, settings]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:375
msgid "Mobile widgets (issue #553)"
msgstr "モバイルウィジェット(issue #553)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:377
msgid "BottomNavigation"
msgstr "BottomNavigation"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:379
msgid ""
"5-tab bottom bar with icon + label + badge per tab. `onSelect(index)` fires "
"when the user taps; `bottomNavSetSelected` is the programmatic counterpart "
"and does NOT fire `onSelect`."
msgstr ""
"タブごとにアイコン+ラベル+バッジの5つのタブ付き下のバー. `onSelect(index)`は"
"ユーザがタップするときに発射される. `bottomNavSetSelected`はプログラム対称で"
"あり,NOTは`onSelect`を発射する."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:383
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  BottomNavigation,\n"
"  bottomNavAddItem,\n"
"  bottomNavSetBadge,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const bar = BottomNavigation((index) => {\n"
"  console.log(\"tab:\", index);\n"
"});\n"
"bottomNavAddItem(bar, \"house\", \"Home\");\n"
"bottomNavAddItem(bar, \"magnifyingglass\", \"Search\");\n"
"bottomNavAddItem(bar, \"bell\", \"Activity\");\n"
"bottomNavSetBadge(bar, 2, \"5\");\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  BottomNavigation,\n"
"  bottomNavAddItem,\n"
"  bottomNavSetBadge,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const bar = BottomNavigation((index) => {\n"
"  console.log(\"tab:\", index);\n"
"});\n"
"bottomNavAddItem(bar, \"house\", \"Home\");\n"
"bottomNavAddItem(bar, \"magnifyingglass\", \"Search\");\n"
"bottomNavAddItem(bar, \"bell\", \"Activity\");\n"
"bottomNavSetBadge(bar, 2, \"5\");\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:399
msgid ""
"Real on macOS (`NSStackView` + `NSButton` strip with SF Symbol icons), iOS "
"(`UITabBar`), Android (custom `LinearLayout` strip with badge overlay), and "
"GTK4 (`GtkBox` + Adwaita CSS). Stub on Windows, tvOS, visionOS, watchOS."
msgstr ""
"macOS(SF Symbolアイコン付きの`NSStackView` + `NSButton`ストリップ)、"
"iOS(`UITabBar`)、Android(バッジオーバーレイ付きカスタム`LinearLayout`ストリッ"
"プ)、GTK4(`GtkBox` + Adwaita CSS)で実装。Windows、tvOS、visionOS、watchOSでは"
"スタブ。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:404
msgid "ImageGallery"
msgstr "ImageGallery"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:406
msgid ""
"Swipeable, paging carousel of images. Local file paths load synchronously; "
"HTTP/HTTPS URLs are fetched on a background queue and applied on the main "
"thread."
msgstr ""
"スワイプ可能でページング可能な画像カルーセル。ローカルファイルパスは同期的に"
"ロードされます;HTTP/HTTPS URLはバックグラウンドキューで取得され、メインスレッ"
"ドで適用されます。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:410
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { ImageGallery, imageGalleryAddImage } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const gallery = ImageGallery((idx) => console.log(\"page:\", idx));\n"
"imageGalleryAddImage(gallery, \"/photos/01.jpg\", \"Hero shot\");\n"
"imageGalleryAddImage(gallery, \"https://cdn.example/photo2.jpg\", \"Wide "
"angle\");\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { ImageGallery, imageGalleryAddImage } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const gallery = ImageGallery((idx) => console.log(\"page:\", idx));\n"
"imageGalleryAddImage(gallery, \"/photos/01.jpg\", \"Hero shot\");\n"
"imageGalleryAddImage(gallery, \"https://cdn.example/photo2.jpg\", \"Wide "
"angle\");\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:418
msgid ""
"Real on macOS (`NSScrollView` paging), iOS (`UIScrollView` with "
"`scrollViewDidEndDecelerating`), Android (`HorizontalScrollView`), GTK4 "
"(`GtkScrolledWindow` + `GtkPicture`). Stub on Windows, tvOS, visionOS, "
"watchOS."
msgstr ""
"macOS(`NSScrollView`ページング)、iOS(`scrollViewDidEndDecelerating`付きの"
"`UIScrollView`)、Android(`HorizontalScrollView`)、GTK4(`GtkScrolledWindow` + "
"`GtkPicture`)で実装。Windows、tvOS、visionOS、watchOSではスタブ。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:423
msgid "Pull-to-refresh"
msgstr "プルトゥリフレッシュ"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:425
msgid ""
"Available on `ScrollView` and `LazyVStack`. The `onPull` callback fires once "
"when the user pulls past the threshold; call `scrollviewEndRefreshing` (or "
"`lazyvstackEndRefreshing`) when your async fetch settles to dismiss the "
"spinner."
msgstr ""
"`ScrollView`と`LazyVStack`で利用可能。`onPull`コールバックはユーザーがしきい"
"値を超えて引いたときに1回発火します;非同期フェッチが完了したときにスピナーを"
"閉じるには`scrollviewEndRefreshing`(または`lazyvstackEndRefreshing`)を呼び出"
"します。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:430
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  ScrollView,\n"
"  scrollviewSetRefreshControl,\n"
"  scrollviewEndRefreshing,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const scroll = ScrollView();\n"
"scrollviewSetRefreshControl(scroll, async () => {\n"
"  await refreshFeed();\n"
"  scrollviewEndRefreshing(scroll);\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  ScrollView,\n"
"  scrollviewSetRefreshControl,\n"
"  scrollviewEndRefreshing,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const scroll = ScrollView();\n"
"scrollviewSetRefreshControl(scroll, async () => {\n"
"  await refreshFeed();\n"
"  scrollviewEndRefreshing(scroll);\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:444
msgid ""
"Real on iOS (`UIRefreshControl`). The macOS / Android / GTK4 / Windows "
"desktops have no native pull-to-refresh idiom — they're documented no-ops."
msgstr ""
"iOS(`UIRefreshControl`)で実装。macOS / Android / GTK4 / Windowsデスクトップに"
"はネイティブのプルトゥリフレッシュイディオムがありません — それらは文書化され"
"たノーオペです。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:448
msgid "Infinite scroll (`onScrollEnd`)"
msgstr "無限スクロール(`onScrollEnd`)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:450
msgid ""
"Fires once when the user scrolls past `thresholdPx` (or `thresholdItems` for "
"`LazyVStack`) from the bottom; re-arms after the user scrolls back up past "
"the threshold so a single fetch is queued at a time."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーが下から`thresholdPx`(または`LazyVStack`の場合は`thresholdItems`)を超"
"えてスクロールしたときに1回発火します;ユーザーがしきい値を超えて再度上にスク"
"ロールした後に再アームされ、一度に1つのフェッチがキューに入ります。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:454
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { ScrollView, scrollviewSetScrollEndCallback } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const scroll = ScrollView();\n"
"scrollviewSetScrollEndCallback(\n"
"  scroll,\n"
"  () => loadMore(),\n"
"  200, // threshold in pixels from the bottom\n"
");\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { ScrollView, scrollviewSetScrollEndCallback } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const scroll = ScrollView();\n"
"scrollviewSetScrollEndCallback(\n"
"  scroll,\n"
"  () => loadMore(),\n"
"  200, // threshold in pixels from the bottom\n"
");\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:465
msgid ""
"Real on every platform that has a scroll view: macOS "
"(`NSViewBoundsDidChangeNotification`), iOS "
"(`UIScrollViewDelegate.scrollViewDidScroll`), Android "
"(`View.OnScrollChangeListener`), GTK4 (`GtkAdjustment::value-changed`), "
"Windows (`WM_VSCROLL` / `WM_MOUSEWHEEL`)."
msgstr ""
"スクロールビューを持つすべてのプラットフォームで実装: macOS "
"(`NSViewBoundsDidChangeNotification`)、iOS "
"(`UIScrollViewDelegate.scrollViewDidScroll`)、Android "
"(`View.OnScrollChangeListener`)、GTK4 (`GtkAdjustment::value-changed`)、"
"Windows (`WM_VSCROLL` / `WM_MOUSEWHEEL`)。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:471
msgid "Platform-specific widgets"
msgstr "プラットフォーム固有のウィジェット"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:473
msgid ""
"These exist only on specific platforms and aren't verified by the cross-"
"platform doc-tests:"
msgstr ""
"これらは特定のプラットフォームにのみ存在し、クロスプラットフォームのdoc-tests"
"では検証されていません:"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:476
msgid ""
"**`Table(rows, cols, renderer)`** — macOS only. Now supports "
"`tableSetSortColumn`, `tableSetFilterText`, and multi-select since v0.5.636 "
"(#473)."
msgstr ""
"**`Table(rows, cols, renderer)`** — macOSのみ。v0.5.636 (#473)以降、"
"`tableSetSortColumn`、`tableSetFilterText`、複数選択をサポートしています。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:479
msgid "**`QRCode(data, size)`** — macOS only. Renders a QR code."
msgstr "**`QRCode(data, size)`** — macOS限定。QRコードをレンダリングします。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:480
msgid ""
"**`Canvas(width, height, draw)`** — all desktop platforms. A drawing "
"surface; see [Canvas](canvas.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`Canvas(width, height, draw)`** — すべてのデスクトッププラットフォーム。描"
"画サーフェス;[Canvas](canvas.md)を参照。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:482
msgid ""
"**`CameraView()`** — iOS only (other platforms planned). See [Camera]"
"(camera.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`CameraView()`** — iOS限定(他のプラットフォームは予定)。[Camera](camera.md)"
"を参照。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:485
msgid "Combobox (issue #475)"
msgstr "コンボボックス(issue #475)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:487
msgid ""
"Editable text field with a filterable dropdown of suggestions. macOS uses "
"`NSComboBox` with as-you-type completion; other platforms stub the FFI today "
"(the field falls back to a plain editable field)."
msgstr ""
"提案のフィルタ可能なドロップダウン付きの編集可能なテキストフィールド。macOSは"
"入力中の補完付きの`NSComboBox`を使用します;他のプラットフォームは現在FFIをス"
"タブ化しています(フィールドは普通の編集可能フィールドにフォールバックしま"
"す)。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:491
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Combobox, comboboxAddItem, comboboxGetValue } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const combo = Combobox(\"\", (v) => console.log(\"picked:\", v));\n"
"comboboxAddItem(combo, \"apple\");\n"
"comboboxAddItem(combo, \"apricot\");\n"
"comboboxAddItem(combo, \"avocado\");\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Combobox, comboboxAddItem, comboboxGetValue } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const combo = Combobox(\"\", (v) => console.log(\"picked:\", v));\n"
"comboboxAddItem(combo, \"apple\");\n"
"comboboxAddItem(combo, \"apricot\");\n"
"comboboxAddItem(combo, \"avocado\");\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:500
msgid "TreeView / Outline (issue #480)"
msgstr "TreeView / アウトライン(issue #480)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:502
msgid ""
"Hierarchical disclosure list. Build the topology bottom-up via `TreeNode`"
msgstr ""
"階層的な開示リスト。`TreeNode`経由でボトムアップでトポロジーを構築します"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:503
msgid ""
"`treeNodeAddChild`, then mount it via `TreeView`. macOS uses "
"`NSOutlineView`; other platforms stub."
msgstr ""
"`treeNodeAddChild`の後、`TreeView`経由でマウントします。macOSは"
"`NSOutlineView`を使用;他のプラットフォームはスタブ。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:506
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { TreeNode, treeNodeAddChild, TreeView } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const dox = TreeNode(\"docs\", \"Documents\");\n"
"treeNodeAddChild(dox, TreeNode(\"doc-1\", \"Resume.pdf\"));\n"
"treeNodeAddChild(dox, TreeNode(\"doc-2\", \"Cover Letter.pdf\"));\n"
"const root = TreeNode(\"root\", \"Files\");\n"
"treeNodeAddChild(root, dox);\n"
"const tree = TreeView(root, (id) => console.log(\"selected:\", id));\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { TreeNode, treeNodeAddChild, TreeView } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const dox = TreeNode(\"docs\", \"Documents\");\n"
"treeNodeAddChild(dox, TreeNode(\"doc-1\", \"Resume.pdf\"));\n"
"treeNodeAddChild(dox, TreeNode(\"doc-2\", \"Cover Letter.pdf\"));\n"
"const root = TreeNode(\"root\", \"Files\");\n"
"treeNodeAddChild(root, dox);\n"
"const tree = TreeView(root, (id) => console.log(\"selected:\", id));\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:517
msgid "Calendar (issue #481)"
msgstr "カレンダー(issue #481)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:519
msgid ""
"Month-grid date picker. macOS uses `NSDatePicker` in graphical style; other "
"platforms stub. `onChange` receives the selected date as an ISO `yyyy-MM-dd` "
"string."
msgstr ""
"月グリッド日付ピッカー。macOSはグラフィカルスタイルの`NSDatePicker`を使用しま"
"す;他のプラットフォームはスタブ。`onChange`は選択された日付をISO `yyyy-MM-dd`"
"文字列として受け取ります。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:523
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Calendar, calendarGetSelectedDate } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const cal = Calendar(2026, 5, (iso) => console.log(\"date:\", iso));\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Calendar, calendarGetSelectedDate } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const cal = Calendar(2026, 5, (iso) => console.log(\"date:\", iso));\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:529
msgid "DatePicker (issue #4772)"
msgstr "DatePicker (issue #4772)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:531
msgid ""
"Compact field-style date picker — the space-saving complement to the month-"
"grid `Calendar`. Each platform uses its native compact date control: macOS "
"`NSDatePicker` (text-field-and-stepper), iOS / visionOS `UIDatePicker` "
"(`.compact`), Windows `SysDateTimePick32`, Android "
"`android.widget.DatePicker`. GTK4 has no native compact date field, so it "
"reuses `GtkCalendar`; tvOS / watchOS stub. `onChange` receives the selected "
"date as an ISO `yyyy-MM-dd` string."
msgstr ""
"コンパクトなフィールドスタイルの日付ピッカー — 月グリッド表示の `Calendar` を"
"補完する省スペースな代替手段です。各プラットフォームはネイティブのコンパクト"
"日付コントロールを使用します: macOS は `NSDatePicker`（テキストフィールド＋ス"
"テッパー）、iOS / visionOS は `UIDatePicker`（`.compact`）、Windows は "
"`SysDateTimePick32`、Android は `android.widget.DatePicker`。GTK4 にはネイ"
"ティブのコンパクト日付フィールドがないため `GtkCalendar` を再利用します。"
"tvOS / watchOS はスタブです。`onChange` は選択された日付を ISO `yyyy-MM-dd` "
"形式の文字列として受け取ります。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:539
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { DatePicker, datePickerGetSelectedDate } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const picker = DatePicker(2026, 5, (iso) => console.log(\"date:\", iso));\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { DatePicker, datePickerGetSelectedDate } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const picker = DatePicker(2026, 5, (iso) => console.log(\"date:\", iso));\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:545
msgid "Chart (issue #474)"
msgstr "チャート(issue #474)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:547
msgid ""
"Line / bar / pie via CoreGraphics on macOS. `kind` is `0=line`, `1=bar`, "
"`2=pie`. Apple Charts framework / SwiftUI Charts integration on iOS 16+ is a "
"follow-up."
msgstr ""
"macOSのCoreGraphics経由の線 / バー / 円グラフ。`kind`は`0=line`、`1=bar`、"
"`2=pie`です。iOS 16+でのApple Chartsフレームワーク / SwiftUI Charts統合はフォ"
"ローアップです。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:551
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Chart, chartAddDataPoint, chartSetTitle } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const chart = Chart(0, 600, 400);\n"
"chartSetTitle(chart, \"Visits\");\n"
"chartAddDataPoint(chart, \"Mon\", 12);\n"
"chartAddDataPoint(chart, \"Tue\", 18);\n"
"chartAddDataPoint(chart, \"Wed\", 9);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import { Chart, chartAddDataPoint, chartSetTitle } from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const chart = Chart(0, 600, 400);\n"
"chartSetTitle(chart, \"Visits\");\n"
"chartAddDataPoint(chart, \"Mon\", 12);\n"
"chartAddDataPoint(chart, \"Tue\", 18);\n"
"chartAddDataPoint(chart, \"Wed\", 9);\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:561
msgid "Command palette (issue #477)"
msgstr "コマンドパレット(issue #477)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:563
msgid ""
"⌘K-style fuzzy command launcher. macOS shows a floating `NSPanel`; other "
"platforms stub. Bind `commandPaletteShow()` to ⌘K via `addKeyboardShortcut` "
"to wire the default hotkey."
msgstr ""
"⌘Kスタイルのファジーコマンドランチャー。macOSはフローティングの`NSPanel`を表"
"示します;他のプラットフォームはスタブ。デフォルトのホットキーを配線するために"
"`addKeyboardShortcut`経由で`commandPaletteShow()`を⌘Kにバインドします。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:567
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  commandPaletteRegister,\n"
"  commandPaletteShow,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"commandPaletteRegister(\"save\", \"Save\", \"⌘S\", () => save());\n"
"commandPaletteRegister(\"export\", \"Export PDF\", \"\", () => "
"exportPdf());\n"
"// then:\n"
"commandPaletteShow();\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  commandPaletteRegister,\n"
"  commandPaletteShow,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"commandPaletteRegister(\"save\", \"Save\", \"⌘S\", () => save());\n"
"commandPaletteRegister(\"export\", \"Export PDF\", \"\", () => "
"exportPdf());\n"
"// then:\n"
"commandPaletteShow();\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:579
msgid "MapView (issue #517)"
msgstr "MapView(issue #517)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:581
msgid ""
"Wraps `MKMapView` on macOS / iOS / visionOS / tvOS, `libshumate` on GTK4, "
"Google Maps SDK on Android (requires API key in `AndroidManifest.xml`), the "
"SwiftUI `Map` view on watchOS, and the native Windows `MapControl` in a XAML "
"Island. On Windows, obtain a Bing Maps key as described in Microsoft's [maps "
"authentication guide](https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/uwp/maps-and-"
"location/authentication-key), then set `PERRY_MAP_SERVICE_TOKEN` (or the "
"legacy `PERRY_BING_MAPS_KEY` alias) before launching the app. The token is "
"read when each MapView is created and assigned to "
"`MapControl.MapServiceToken`."
msgstr ""
"macOS / iOS / visionOS / tvOS に `MKMapView`, GTK4 に `libshumate`, Android "
"に Google Maps SDK (`AndroidManifest.xml` に API キーを必要とする), watchOS "
"に SwiftUI `Map` ビュー, XAML 島でネイティブ Windows `MapControl` を包み込"
"む. Windows では,Microsoft の [マップ認証ガイド](https://learn.microsoft.com/"
"windows/uwp/maps-and-location/authentication-key) で説明されているように "
"Bing マップス キーを取得し,アプリを起動する前に `PERRY_MAP_SERVICE_TOKEN` (ま"
"たは古い `PERRY_BING_MAPS_KEY` 别名) を設定します. MapView が作成さ"
"れ,`MapControl.MapServiceToken` に割り当てられるとトークンは読み取れます."

#: src/ui/widgets.md:590
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  MapView,\n"
"  mapViewSetRegion,\n"
"  mapViewAddPin,\n"
"  mapViewSetMapType,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const map = MapView(800, 600);\n"
"mapViewSetRegion(map, 37.7749, -122.4194, 0.05, 0.05);\n"
"mapViewAddPin(map, 37.7749, -122.4194, \"San Francisco\");\n"
"mapViewSetMapType(map, 1); // 0=standard, 1=satellite, 2=hybrid\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  MapView,\n"
"  mapViewSetRegion,\n"
"  mapViewAddPin,\n"
"  mapViewSetMapType,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const map = MapView(800, 600);\n"
"mapViewSetRegion(map, 37.7749, -122.4194, 0.05, 0.05);\n"
"mapViewAddPin(map, 37.7749, -122.4194, \"San Francisco\");\n"
"mapViewSetMapType(map, 1); // 0=standard, 1=satellite, 2=hybrid\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:604
msgid "PdfView (issue #516)"
msgstr "PdfView(issue #516)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:606
msgid ""
"Native PDF rendering uses PDFKit on macOS / iOS / visionOS and "
"`Windows.Data.Pdf` with a GDI+ page surface on Windows. `pdfViewLoadFile` "
"returns 1 on success, 0 on failure. Page navigation and zoom redraw real "
"document pixels on both backends."
msgstr ""
"PDFのネイティブレンダリングは,WindowsでGDI+ページ表面を持つmacOS / iOS / "
"visionOSと`Windows.Data.Pdf`でPDFKitを使用しています. `pdfViewLoadFile` は成"
"功時に 1 と失敗時に 0 を返します ページナビゲーションとズームは 両方のバック"
"エンドで実際のドキュメントのピクセルを再描画します"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:611
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  PdfView,\n"
"  pdfViewLoadFile,\n"
"  pdfViewGetPageCount,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const pdf = PdfView(800, 600);\n"
"if (pdfViewLoadFile(pdf, \"/tmp/report.pdf\")) {\n"
"  console.log(\"pages:\", pdfViewGetPageCount(pdf));\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  PdfView,\n"
"  pdfViewLoadFile,\n"
"  pdfViewGetPageCount,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const pdf = PdfView(800, 600);\n"
"if (pdfViewLoadFile(pdf, \"/tmp/report.pdf\")) {\n"
"  console.log(\"pages:\", pdfViewGetPageCount(pdf));\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:624
msgid "RichTextEditor (issue #478)"
msgstr "RichTextEditor(issue #478)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:626
msgid ""
"`NSTextView` with `NSAttributedString` storage on macOS. Plain-text and HTML "
"round-trip cover persistence; `richTextToggleBold` / `ToggleItalic` / "
"`ToggleUnderline` cover inline formatting via `NSResponder` actions."
msgstr ""
"macOSの`NSAttributedString`ストレージ付き`NSTextView`。プレーンテキストとHTML"
"のラウンドトリップが永続化をカバーします;`richTextToggleBold` / "
"`ToggleItalic` / `ToggleUnderline`は`NSResponder`アクション経由でインライン"
"フォーマットをカバーします。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:631
msgid ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  RichTextEditor,\n"
"  richTextSetHtml,\n"
"  richTextGetHtml,\n"
"  richTextToggleBold,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const editor = RichTextEditor(600, 400, (text) => console.log(text));\n"
"richTextSetHtml(editor, \"<p>Hello <b>world</b></p>\");\n"
"richTextToggleBold(editor);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript,no-test\n"
"import {\n"
"  RichTextEditor,\n"
"  richTextSetHtml,\n"
"  richTextGetHtml,\n"
"  richTextToggleBold,\n"
"} from \"perry/ui\";\n"
"\n"
"const editor = RichTextEditor(600, 400, (text) => console.log(text));\n"
"richTextSetHtml(editor, \"<p>Hello <b>world</b></p>\");\n"
"richTextToggleBold(editor);\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:644
msgid "Rich tooltip (issue #479)"
msgstr "リッチツールチップ(issue #479)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:646
msgid ""
"`widgetSetRichTooltip(widget, content, hoverDelayMs)` — like "
"`widgetSetTooltip` but the tooltip content is itself a Perry widget. macOS "
"uses `NSPanel` + `NSTrackingArea`; other platforms stub. For plain-text "
"tooltips with VoiceOver / a11y support, prefer the simpler "
"`widgetSetTooltip`."
msgstr ""
"`widgetSetRichTooltip(widget, content, hoverDelayMs)` — `widgetSetTooltip`に"
"似ていますが、ツールチップコンテンツ自体がPerryウィジェットです。macOSは"
"`NSPanel` + `NSTrackingArea`を使用します;他のプラットフォームはスタブ。"
"VoiceOver / a11yサポート付きのプレーンテキストツールチップには、よりシンプル"
"な`widgetSetTooltip`を優先します。"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:652
msgid "WebView (issue #658)"
msgstr "WebView (issue #658)"

#: src/ui/widgets.md:654
msgid ""
"`WebView({ url, allowedDomains?, onShouldNavigate?, ... })` embeds a real "
"browser engine — `WKWebView` on Apple, `WebView2` on Windows, `WebKitGTK "
"6.0` on Linux, `android.webkit.WebView` on Android, sandboxed `<iframe>` on "
"web. See [WebView](webview.md) for the full OAuth / callback-interception "
"pattern and the per-platform notes."
msgstr ""
"`WebView({ url, allowedDomains?, onShouldNavigate?, ... })` は実際のブラウザ"
"エンジンを埋め込みます — Apple では `WKWebView`、Windows では `WebView2`、"
"Linux では `WebKitGTK 6.0`、Android では `android.webkit.WebView`、Web ではサ"
"ンドボックス化された `<iframe>` を使用します。完全な OAuth / コールバックイン"
"ターセプトのパターンおよびプラットフォーム固有の注意事項については [WebView]"
"(webview.md) を参照してください。"

