#: src/ui/layout.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry provides layout containers that arrange child widgets using the "
"platform's native layout system. Every snippet below is excerpted from "
"[`docs/examples/ui/layout/snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/layout/"
"snippets.ts) — CI compiles and runs it on every PR."
msgstr ""
"Perryはプラットフォームのネイティブレイアウトシステムを使用して子ウィジェット"
"を配置するレイアウトコンテナを提供します。以下のすべてのスニペットは[`docs/"
"examples/ui/layout/snippets.ts`](../../examples/ui/layout/snippets.ts)からの"
"抜粋です — CIはすべてのPRでコンパイルして実行します。"

#: src/ui/layout.md:8
msgid ""
"Layout helpers are free functions: `widgetAddChild(parent, child)`, "
"`stackSetAlignment(stack, value)`, `widgetSetEdgeInsets(w, top, left, "
"bottom,  right)`, etc. Stack constructors take a numeric spacing followed by "
"a child array; everything else (alignment, distribution, padding, sizing) is "
"applied post-construction via the free functions on the widget handle."
msgstr ""
"レイアウトヘルパーは無料の機能である. `widgetAddChild(parent, child)`, "
"`stackSetAlignment(stack, value)`, `widgetSetEdgeInsets(w, top, left, "
"bottom,  right)`など. スタックコンストラクタは子配列が続く数値間隔をとり,他の"
"すべて (アライナメント,分布,パッディング,サイズ) はウィジェットハンドルのフ"
"リー関数を通じて建設後適用されます."

#: src/ui/layout.md:14 src/platforms/watchos.md:141 src/platforms/android.md:34
#: src/platforms/linux.md:48 src/widgets/components.md:40
msgid "VStack"
msgstr "VStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:16
msgid "Arranges children vertically (top to bottom)."
msgstr "子を垂直方向(上から下)に配置します。"

#: src/ui/layout.md:18
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const stack = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"First\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Second\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Third\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const stack = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"First\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Second\"),\n"
"    Text(\"Third\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:26
msgid ""
"`VStack(spacing, children)` — the first argument is the gap in points "
"between children."
msgstr ""
"`VStack(spacing, children)` — 最初の引数は子間のギャップ(ポイント単位)です。"

#: src/ui/layout.md:29 src/platforms/watchos.md:142 src/platforms/android.md:35
#: src/platforms/linux.md:49 src/widgets/components.md:49
msgid "HStack"
msgstr "HStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:31
msgid "Arranges children horizontally (left to right)."
msgstr "子を水平方向(左から右)に配置します。"

#: src/ui/layout.md:33
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const row = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Button(\"Cancel\", noop),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Button(\"OK\", noop),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const row = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Button(\"Cancel\", noop),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Button(\"OK\", noop),\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:41 src/platforms/watchos.md:143 src/platforms/android.md:36
#: src/platforms/linux.md:50 src/widgets/components.md:59
msgid "ZStack"
msgstr "ZStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:43
msgid ""
"Layers children on top of each other (back to front). `ZStack()` takes no "
"constructor children — populate it with `widgetAddChild`:"
msgstr ""
"子を互いに重ねて重ねます(後ろから前へ)。`ZStack()`はコンストラクタの子を取り"
"ません — `widgetAddChild`で埋めます:"

#: src/ui/layout.md:46
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const layered = ZStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, ImageFile(\"background.png\"))\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, Text(\"Overlay text\"))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const layered = ZStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, ImageFile(\"background.png\"))\n"
"widgetAddChild(layered, Text(\"Overlay text\"))\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:52 src/platforms/macos.md:35 src/platforms/ios.md:61
#: src/platforms/tvos.md:60 src/platforms/watchos.md:149
#: src/platforms/android.md:37 src/platforms/windows.md:61
#: src/platforms/linux.md:51 src/testing/geisterhand.md:94
msgid "ScrollView"
msgstr "ScrollView"

#: src/ui/layout.md:54
msgid ""
"A scrollable container. Built empty, then filled via `scrollviewSetChild`:"
msgstr ""
"スクロール可能なコンテナ。空で構築し、その後`scrollviewSetChild`経由で埋めま"
"す:"

#: src/ui/layout.md:56
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// ScrollView() takes no args; populate it with `scrollviewSetChild`.\n"
"const sv = ScrollView()\n"
"const inner = VStack(8, [Text(\"a\"), Text(\"b\"), Text(\"c\")])\n"
"scrollviewSetChild(sv, inner)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// ScrollView() takes no args; populate it with `scrollviewSetChild`.\n"
"const sv = ScrollView()\n"
"const inner = VStack(8, [Text(\"a\"), Text(\"b\"), Text(\"c\")])\n"
"scrollviewSetChild(sv, inner)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:63
msgid "LazyVStack"
msgstr "LazyVStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:65
msgid ""
"A vertically scrolling list that lazily renders items. More efficient than "
"`ScrollView` + `VStack` for thousands of rows — on macOS this is backed by "
"`NSTableView` so only rows in the visible rect are realized."
msgstr ""
"アイテムを遅延レンダリングする垂直スクロールリスト。数千行に対しては"
"`ScrollView` + `VStack`より効率的です — macOSではこれは`NSTableView`によって"
"サポートされており、可視矩形内の行のみが実現されます。"

#: src/ui/layout.md:69
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// `render(index)` is invoked lazily — only rows in the visible rect are "
"realized.\n"
"const lazy = LazyVStack(1000, (index: number) => Text(`Row ${index}`))\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// `render(index)` is invoked lazily — only rows in the visible rect are "
"realized.\n"
"const lazy = LazyVStack(1000, (index: number) => Text(`Row ${index}`))\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:74
msgid ""
"When the underlying data changes, call `lazyvstackUpdate(handle, newCount)` "
"to refresh. Override the default 44pt row height with "
"`lazyvstackSetRowHeight`."
msgstr ""
"基礎データが変更された場合、`lazyvstackUpdate(handle, newCount)`を呼び出して"
"リフレッシュします。デフォルトの44pt行高を`lazyvstackSetRowHeight`で上書きし"
"ます。"

#: src/ui/layout.md:77
msgid "NavStack"
msgstr "NavStack"

#: src/ui/layout.md:79
msgid ""
"A navigation container that supports push/pop navigation. Push a new view "
"with `navstackPush(stack, view, title)`; pop with `navstackPop(stack)`:"
msgstr ""
"プッシュ/ポップナビゲーションをサポートするナビゲーションコンテナ。"
"`navstackPush(stack, view, title)`で新しいビューをプッ"
"シュ;`navstackPop(stack)`でポップ:"

#: src/ui/layout.md:82
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const home = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"Home Screen\"),\n"
"    Button(\"Go to Details\", () => {\n"
"        navstackPush(nav, Text(\"Details!\"), \"Details\")\n"
"    }),\n"
"])\n"
"const nav = NavStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(nav, home)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const home = VStack(16, [\n"
"    Text(\"Home Screen\"),\n"
"    Button(\"Go to Details\", () => {\n"
"        navstackPush(nav, Text(\"Details!\"), \"Details\")\n"
"    }),\n"
"])\n"
"const nav = NavStack()\n"
"widgetAddChild(nav, home)\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:93 src/platforms/watchos.md:144
#: src/widgets/components.md:68 src/widgets/platforms.md:30
#: src/widgets/platforms.md:31
msgid "Spacer"
msgstr "Spacer"

#: src/ui/layout.md:95
msgid "A flexible space that expands to fill available room."
msgstr "利用可能なスペースを埋めるように拡張する柔軟なスペース。"

#: src/ui/layout.md:97
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const toolbar = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Text(\"Left\"),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Text(\"Right\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const toolbar = HStack(8, [\n"
"    Text(\"Left\"),\n"
"    Spacer(),\n"
"    Text(\"Right\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:105
msgid "Use `Spacer()` inside `HStack` or `VStack` to push widgets apart."
msgstr "`HStack`または`VStack`内で`Spacer()`を使用してウィジェットを離します。"

#: src/ui/layout.md:107 src/platforms/watchos.md:145
#: src/widgets/components.md:103 src/widgets/platforms.md:31
msgid "Divider"
msgstr "Divider"

#: src/ui/layout.md:109
msgid "A visual separator line."
msgstr "視覚的な区切り線。"

#: src/ui/layout.md:111
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const sections = VStack(12, [\n"
"    Text(\"Section 1\"),\n"
"    Divider(),\n"
"    Text(\"Section 2\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const sections = VStack(12, [\n"
"    Text(\"Section 1\"),\n"
"    Divider(),\n"
"    Text(\"Section 2\"),\n"
"])\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:119
msgid "Nesting Layouts"
msgstr "レイアウトのネスト"

#: src/ui/layout.md:121
msgid "Layouts can be nested freely. This complete example is verified by CI:"
msgstr "レイアウトは自由にネストできます。この完全な例はCIで検証されています:"

#: src/ui/layout.md:123
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"// demonstrates: nested VStack/HStack + Spacer + Divider\n"
"// docs: docs/src/ui/layout.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: ios-simulator, web, wasm\n"
"\n"
"import { App, VStack, HStack, Text, Button, Spacer, Divider } from \"perry/"
"ui\"\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"Layout Example\",\n"
"    width: 800,\n"
"    height: 600,\n"
"    body: VStack(16, [\n"
"        // Header\n"
"        HStack(8, [\n"
"            Text(\"My App\"),\n"
"            Spacer(),\n"
"            Button(\"Settings\", () => {}),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"        Divider(),\n"
"        // Content\n"
"        VStack(12, [\n"
"            Text(\"Welcome!\"),\n"
"            HStack(8, [\n"
"                Button(\"Action 1\", () => {}),\n"
"                Button(\"Action 2\", () => {}),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"        Spacer(),\n"
"        // Footer\n"
"        Text(\"v1.0.0\"),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"// demonstrates: nested VStack/HStack + Spacer + Divider\n"
"// docs: docs/src/ui/layout.md\n"
"// platforms: macos, linux, windows\n"
"// targets: ios-simulator, web, wasm\n"
"\n"
"import { App, VStack, HStack, Text, Button, Spacer, Divider } from \"perry/"
"ui\"\n"
"\n"
"App({\n"
"    title: \"Layout Example\",\n"
"    width: 800,\n"
"    height: 600,\n"
"    body: VStack(16, [\n"
"        // Header\n"
"        HStack(8, [\n"
"            Text(\"My App\"),\n"
"            Spacer(),\n"
"            Button(\"Settings\", () => {}),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"        Divider(),\n"
"        // Content\n"
"        VStack(12, [\n"
"            Text(\"Welcome!\"),\n"
"            HStack(8, [\n"
"                Button(\"Action 1\", () => {}),\n"
"                Button(\"Action 2\", () => {}),\n"
"            ]),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"        Spacer(),\n"
"        // Footer\n"
"        Text(\"v1.0.0\"),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/ui/layout.md:158
msgid "Child Management"
msgstr "子の管理"

#: src/ui/layout.md:160
msgid "Containers support dynamic child management via free functions:"
msgstr "コンテナはフリー関数経由で動的な子管理をサポートします:"

#: src/ui/layout.md:162
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"const list = VStack(16, [])\n"
"widgetAddChild(list, Text(\"appended\"))            // append\n"
"widgetAddChildAt(list, Text(\"prepended\"), 0)      // insert at index\n"
"widgetReorderChild(list, 1, 0)                    // move from→to\n"
"const removeMe = Text(\"temporary\")\n"
"widgetAddChild(list, removeMe)\n"
"widgetRemoveChild(list, removeMe)                 // remove\n"
"widgetClearChildren(list)                         // remove all\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"const list = VStack(16, [])\n"
"widgetAddChild(list, Text(\"appended\"))            // append\n"
"widgetAddChildAt(list, Text(\"prepended\"), 0)      // insert at index\n"
"widgetReorderChild(list, 1, 0)                    // move from→to\n"
"const removeMe = Text(\"temporary\")\n"
"widgetAddChild(list, removeMe)\n"
"widgetRemoveChild(list, removeMe)                 // remove\n"
"widgetClearChildren(list)                         // remove all\n"
"```"

