#: src/ui/multi-window.md:10
msgid ""
"`Window(title, width, height)` returns a window handle. Call `.setBody()` to "
"set its content and `.show()` to display it:"
msgstr ""
"`Window(title, width, height)`はウィンドウハンドルを返します。`.setBody()`を"
