#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:1
msgid "Publishing watchOS Apps to the App Store"
msgstr "watchOS アプリをApp Storeに公開する"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:3
msgid ""
"Shipping a **watch-only** app (no iPhone app) through App Store Connect has "
"two non-obvious requirements that aren't enforced until you upload. This "
"page covers both, plus the architecture/deployment-target rules that decide "
"which watches your build reaches."
msgstr ""
"輸送する **ウォッチのみ** アップル iPhone アップロードするまで 強制されない 2"
"つの要求があります このページでは両方をカバーし,ビルドがどのウォッチに到達す"
"るかを決める architecture/deployment-target ルールも含まれます."

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:8
msgid "Architecture rules"
msgstr "建築規則"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:10
msgid "App Store validation enforces two rules for the watch app binary:"
msgstr "ウォッチアプリのバイナリには 2つのルールがあります"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:12
msgid "**arm64 is required for every watchOS app**, always."
msgstr "**arm64 はすべての watchOS アプリに必須です**いつも"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:13
msgid "**arm64_32 is _additionally_ required when `MinimumOSVersion < 27.0`.**"
msgstr ""
"**arm64_32 は,`MinimumOSVersion < 27.0` のとき _さらに_ 求められます.**"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:15
msgid "So there are exactly two valid shapes:"
msgstr "2つの形があります"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:17 src/contributing/building.md:27
msgid "Build"
msgstr "ビルド"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:17
msgid "Reaches"
msgstr "Reaches"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:19
msgid "**Fat: arm64 + arm64_32**"
msgstr "**脂肪:アーム64 + arm64_32**"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:19
msgid "\\< 27 (e.g. 10.0)"
msgstr "\\< 27 (e.g. 10.0)"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:19
msgid "Every watch from Series 4 to the latest"
msgstr "4シリーズから最新まで"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:20
msgid "arm64-only"
msgstr "arm64-only"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:20
msgid "≥ 27.0"
msgstr "≥ 27.0"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:20
msgid "Series 9+ only (watchOS 27+)"
msgstr "シリーズ9+のみ (watchOS 27+)"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:22
msgid ""
"An arm64_32-only upload is **rejected** (\"missing arm64 architecture\"). "
"For the widest reach, ship the fat binary with a low deployment target."
msgstr ""
"arm64_32のみのアップロードが **拒否された** \"Arm64のアーキテクチャが欠けてい"
"る\" 最大の範囲で 低発射目標で 太ったバイナリを運べ"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:25
msgid ""
"**arm64-only builds can stall in processing.** A build whose "
"`MinimumOSVersion` is a watchOS version that is not yet generally available "
"(e.g. 27.0 during its beta period) may sit in \"Processing\" indefinitely — "
"Apple's pipeline appears unable to finish it until that OS ships. A fat "
"build targeting a shipped watchOS (e.g. 10.0) processes normally in minutes. "
"Prefer the fat/low-minOS shape unless you specifically need arm64-only."
msgstr ""
"**ARM64のみのビルドは 処理が遅くなる可能性があります** `MinimumOSVersion`が"
"watchOSのバージョンで,まだ一般公開されていないビルド (e.g. 27.0) は,無期限に"
"\"処理\"中に座っている可能性があります. Appleのパイプラインは,そのOSが出荷さ"
"れるまでそれを完了できないようです. 発送されたwatchOS (e.g. 10.0) は通常数分"
"で処理されます arm64のみが必要でない限り,fat/low-minOSの形を好みます."

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:32
msgid "Building the fat binary"
msgstr "脂肪バイナリーを構築"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:34
msgid ""
"Build each slice (see [Building for Device](watchos.md#building-for-"
"device)), re-stamp the arm64 slice's load command down to the shared "
"deployment target (it only ever runs on watchOS 26+ hardware, so the stamp "
"is cosmetic), then `lipo` them together:"
msgstr ""
"各スライス ([装置 の ため の 建築](watchos.md#building-for-device)を参照) を"
"ビルドし,arm64スライスのロードコマンドを共有展開ターゲットに再スタンプします "
"(watchOS 26+ハードウェアでしか実行されませんのでスタンプは化粧品です),それか"
"ら`lipo`を一緒に:"

#: src/platforms/watchos-app-store.md:40
msgid "# 1. arm64_32 slice at the shared deployment target (e.g. 10.0)"
msgstr "# arm64_32 は共有展開目標 (e.g) に切断する. 10.0)"

