"`--target windows-winui` is an opt-in backend for apps that want native "
"WinUI 3 controls and Fluent window chrome. The default `--target windows` "
"path is unchanged and continues to use Win32/GDI."
msgstr ""
"`--target windows-winui`は,ネイティブの WinUI 3 コントロールとFluent window "
