"エントリフィールドはプリミティブを超えるよりリッチな型をサポートします:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:75
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"entryFields: {\n"
"  items: [{ name: \"string\", value: \"number\" }],  // Array of objects\n"
"  subtitle: \"string?\",                             // Optional string\n"
"  stats: { wins: \"number\", losses: \"number\" },     // Nested object\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"entryFields: {\n"
"  items: [{ name: \"string\", value: \"number\" }],  // Array of objects\n"
"  subtitle: \"string?\",                             // Optional string\n"
"  stats: { wins: \"number\", losses: \"number\" },     // Nested object\n"
"}\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:83
msgid "These compile to a Swift `TimelineEntry` struct:"
msgstr "これらはSwiftの`TimelineEntry`構造体にコンパイルされます:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:94
msgid "Conditionals in Render"
msgstr "レンダリング内の条件"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:96
msgid "Use ternary expressions for conditional rendering:"
msgstr "条件付きレンダリングには三項演算式を使用します:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:98
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"ConditionalWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Conditional\",\n"
"    description: \"Renders based on entry data\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        isActive: \"boolean\",\n"
"        count: \"number\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(entry.isActive ? \"Active\" : \"Inactive\"),\n"
"            entry.count > 0 ? Text(`${entry.count} items`) : Spacer(),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"ConditionalWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Conditional\",\n"
"    description: \"Renders based on entry data\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        isActive: \"boolean\",\n"
"        count: \"number\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(entry.isActive ? \"Active\" : \"Inactive\"),\n"
"            entry.count > 0 ? Text(`${entry.count} items`) : Spacer(),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:117
msgid ""
"Template literals in widget text are compiled to Swift string interpolation:"
msgstr ""
"ウィジェットテキスト内のテンプレートリテラルはSwiftの文字列補間にコンパイルさ"
"れます:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:119
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"TemplateLiteralWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Template Literal\",\n"
"    description: \"Template literals compile to Swift string "
"interpolation\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        name: \"string\",\n"
"        score: \"number\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        // Template literal: `${entry.name}: ${entry.score} points`\n"
"        // Compiles to: Text(\"\\(entry.name): \\(entry.score) points\")\n"
"        Text(`${entry.name}: ${entry.score} points`),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"TemplateLiteralWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Template Literal\",\n"
"    description: \"Template literals compile to Swift string "
"interpolation\",\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        name: \"string\",\n"
"        score: \"number\",\n"
"    },\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        // Template literal: `${entry.name}: ${entry.score} points`\n"
"        // Compiles to: Text(\"\\(entry.name): \\(entry.score) points\")\n"
"        Text(`${entry.name}: ${entry.score} points`),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:135
msgid "Configuration Parameters"
msgstr "設定パラメータ"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:137
msgid ""
"The `config` field defines user-editable parameters that appear in the "
"widget's edit UI:"
msgstr ""
"`config`フィールドはウィジェットの編集UIに表示されるユーザー編集可能なパラ"
"メータを定義します:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:139
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"CityWeather\",\n"
"    displayName: \"City Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Weather for a chosen city\",\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        city: { type: \"string\", displayName: \"City\", default: \"New "
"York\" },\n"
"        units: {\n"
"            type: \"enum\",\n"
"            displayName: \"Units\",\n"
"            values: [\"Celsius\", \"Fahrenheit\"],\n"
"            default: \"Celsius\",\n"
"        },\n"
"    },\n"
"    entryFields: { temperature: \"number\", condition: \"string\" },\n"
"    render: (entry) => Text(`${entry.temperature}° ${entry.condition}`),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"CityWeather\",\n"
"    displayName: \"City Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Weather for a chosen city\",\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        city: { type: \"string\", displayName: \"City\", default: \"New "
"York\" },\n"
"        units: {\n"
"            type: \"enum\",\n"
"            displayName: \"Units\",\n"
"            values: [\"Celsius\", \"Fahrenheit\"],\n"
"            default: \"Celsius\",\n"
"        },\n"
"    },\n"
"    entryFields: { temperature: \"number\", condition: \"string\" },\n"
"    render: (entry) => Text(`${entry.temperature}° ${entry.condition}`),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:158
msgid "Provider Function"
msgstr "プロバイダ関数"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:160
msgid ""
"The `provider` field defines a timeline provider that fetches data for the "
"widget:"
msgstr ""
"`provider`フィールドはウィジェットのデータを取得するタイムラインプロバイダを"
"定義します:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:162
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"StockWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Stock Price\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows current stock price\",\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        symbol: { type: \"string\", displayName: \"Symbol\", default: "
"\"AAPL\" },\n"
"    },\n"
"    entryFields: { price: \"number\", change: \"string\" },\n"
"    provider: async (config) => {\n"
"        const res = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/stock/$"
"{config.symbol}`)\n"
"        const data = await res.json()\n"
"        return { price: data.price, change: data.change }\n"
"    },\n"
"    // Inline-options form — the chain form `.font(\"title\")` parses but "
"is\n"
"    // dropped at HIR-lowering time (#195).\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(`$${entry.price}`, { font: \"title\" }),\n"
"            Text(entry.change, { color: \"green\" }),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"StockWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Stock Price\",\n"
"    description: \"Shows current stock price\",\n"
"    config: {\n"
"        symbol: { type: \"string\", displayName: \"Symbol\", default: "
"\"AAPL\" },\n"
"    },\n"
"    entryFields: { price: \"number\", change: \"string\" },\n"
"    provider: async (config) => {\n"
"        const res = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/stock/$"
"{config.symbol}`)\n"
"        const data = await res.json()\n"
"        return { price: data.price, change: data.change }\n"
"    },\n"
"    // Inline-options form — the chain form `.font(\"title\")` parses but "
"is\n"
"    // dropped at HIR-lowering time (#195).\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(`$${entry.price}`, { font: \"title\" }),\n"
"            Text(entry.change, { color: \"green\" }),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:186
msgid ""
"Note: chain-style modifiers (`.font(\"title\").color(\"green\")`) are "
"rejected with a compile-time diagnostic so styling cannot disappear "
"silently; this behavior closed [\\#195](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/"
"issues/195). The verified extract uses the supported inline-options form "
"`Text(\"...\", { font: \"title\" })`."
msgstr ""
"注:チェーン式修正子 (`.font(\"title\").color(\"green\")`) はコンパイルタイム"
"診断で拒否されるため,スタイリングは静かに消えない.この動作は[\\#195](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/195)を閉じます. 検証された抽出文は,サポートさ"
"れているインラインオプション形式 `Text(\"...\", { font: \"title\" })` を使用"
"します."

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:192
msgid "Placeholder Data"
msgstr "プレースホルダデータ"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:194
msgid ""
"When the widget has no data yet (e.g., first load), the provider can return "
"placeholder data by providing a `placeholder` field:"
msgstr ""
"ウィジェットにまだデータがない場合（例: 初回ロード）、プロバイダは "
"`placeholder` フィールドを提供してプレースホルダーデータを返すことができます:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:196
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"NewsWidget\",\n"
"  entryFields: { headline: \"string\", source: \"string\" },\n"
"  placeholder: { headline: \"Loading...\", source: \"---\" },\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"NewsWidget\",\n"
"  entryFields: { headline: \"string\", source: \"string\" },\n"
"  placeholder: { headline: \"Loading...\", source: \"---\" },\n"
"  // ...\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:205
msgid "Family-Specific Rendering"
msgstr "ファミリー固有のレンダリング"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:207
msgid ""
"The render function accepts an optional second parameter for the widget "
"family, allowing different layouts per size:"
msgstr ""
"render 関数は、ウィジェットファミリー用のオプションの第 2 パラメータを受け入"
"れ、サイズごとに異なるレイアウトを可能にします:"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:209
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"render: (entry, family) =>\n"
"  family === \"systemLarge\"\n"
"    ? VStack([\n"
"        Text(entry.title).font(\"title\"),\n"
"        ForEach(entry.items, (item) => Text(item.name)),\n"
"      ])\n"
"    : HStack([\n"
"        Image(\"star.fill\"),\n"
"        Text(entry.title).font(\"headline\"),\n"
"      ]),\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"render: (entry, family) =>\n"
"  family === \"systemLarge\"\n"
"    ? VStack([\n"
"        Text(entry.title).font(\"title\"),\n"
"        ForEach(entry.items, (item) => Text(item.name)),\n"
"      ])\n"
"    : HStack([\n"
"        Image(\"star.fill\"),\n"
"        Text(entry.title).font(\"headline\"),\n"
"      ]),\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:222
msgid ""
"Supported families: `\"systemSmall\"`, `\"systemMedium\"`, "
"`\"systemLarge\"`, `\"accessoryCircular\"`, `\"accessoryRectangular\"`, "
"`\"accessoryInline\"`."
msgstr ""
"サポートされるファミリー: `\"systemSmall\"`、`\"systemMedium\"`、"
"`\"systemLarge\"`、`\"accessoryCircular\"`、`\"accessoryRectangular\"`、"
"`\"accessoryInline\"`。"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:224
msgid "App Group"
msgstr "App Group"

#: src/widgets/creating-widgets.md:226
msgid ""
"The `appGroup` field specifies a shared container for data exchange between "
