#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:5
msgid ""
"**Status:** the basic `WeatherWidget` provider below compile-links cleanly "
"on the host LLVM target via [`docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts`](https://"
"github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/widgets/snippets.ts), so "
"the `provider`/`reloadPolicy`/`entryFields` shapes are verified against the "
"codegen. The shorter fragments lower on the page (a bare `reloadPolicy:`, a "
"`provider:` body without surrounding `Widget({...})`, etc.) are rendered as "
"plain text. The `sharedStorage()` and `preferencesSet()` examples are also "
"rendered as plain text — those symbols are provided by the platform-specific "
"glue (`AppGroupBridge.swift`, `Bridge.kt`) for `--target ios-widget`/"
"`android-widget`/`watchos-widget`/ `wearos-tile` and don't link on the host "
"LLVM target. The cross-compile targets can be driven by the harness with its "
"`// widget-bundle-id:` banner ([\\#194](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/"
"issues/194)). This page's shared snippet requests only the host compile/link "
"check; target execution remains conditional on an available Xcode or Android "
"SDK."
msgstr ""
"**状態:** 以下の基本 `WeatherWidget` プロバイダーは [`docs/examples/widgets/"
"snippets.ts`](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/blob/main/docs/examples/"
"widgets/snippets.ts) を使ってホスト LLVM ターゲットにクリーンにリンクをコンパ"
"イルし,`provider`/`reloadPolicy`/`entryFields` 形状がコードゲンに対して検証さ"
"れます. ページの下部にある短い断片 (裸の`reloadPolicy:`,周囲の`Widget({...})`"
"のない`provider:`ボディなど) は,文字として表示される. `sharedStorage()`と"
"`preferencesSet()`の例は,平文として表示される.これらのシンボルは,`--target "
"ios-widget`/`android-widget`/`watchos-widget`/`wearos-tile`のプラットフォーム"
"特有のグリーブ (`AppGroupBridge.swift`,`Bridge.kt`) によって提供され,ホスト "
"LLVMターゲットにリンクされません. クロスコンパイルのターゲットには `// "
"widget-bundle-id:` バナー ([\\#194](https://github.com/PerryTS/perry/issues/"
"194)) を搭載したハネスで操作できます. このページの共有スニペットは,ホスト "
"compile/link チェックのみを要求します. ターゲット実行は,利用可能な Xcode また"
"は Android SDK に依存します."

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:21
msgid "Provider Lifecycle"
msgstr "プロバイダのライフサイクル"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:23
msgid ""
"The system calls your provider when the widget is first added, when a "
"snapshot is needed, and when the reload policy expires."
msgstr ""
"システムは、ウィジェットが最初に追加されたとき、スナップショットが必要なと"
"き、リロードポリシーが期限切れになったときに、あなたのプロバイダを呼び出しま"
"す。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:24
msgid ""
"Your provider runs as native LLVM-compiled code linked into the widget "
"extension."
msgstr ""
"プロバイダはウィジェット拡張機能にリンクされたネイティブLLVMコンパイルコード"
"として実行されます。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:25
msgid ""
"The provider returns one or more timeline entries. The system renders each "
"entry at its scheduled time."
msgstr ""
"プロバイダは 1 つ以上のタイムラインエントリを返します。システムは各エントリを"
"そのスケジュールされた時刻にレンダリングします。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:26
msgid ""
"After the last entry, the reload policy determines when the provider runs "
"again."
msgstr ""
"最後のエントリの後、リロードポリシーがプロバイダが次に実行されるタイミングを"
"決定します。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:28
msgid "Basic Provider"
msgstr "基本的なプロバイダ"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:30
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"WeatherProviderWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Current conditions\",\n"
"    supportedFamilies: [\"systemSmall\"],\n"
"\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        temperature: \"number\",\n"
"        condition: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    provider: async () => {\n"
"        const res = await fetch(\"https://api.weather.example.com/"
"current\")\n"
"        const data = await res.json()\n"
"        return {\n"
"            entries: [\n"
"                { temperature: data.temp, condition: data.description },\n"
"            ],\n"
"            reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 15 } },\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(`${entry.temperature}°`, { font: \"title\" }),\n"
"            Text(entry.condition, { font: \"caption\" }),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```typescript\n"
"Widget({\n"
"    kind: \"WeatherProviderWidget\",\n"
"    displayName: \"Weather\",\n"
"    description: \"Current conditions\",\n"
"    supportedFamilies: [\"systemSmall\"],\n"
"\n"
"    entryFields: {\n"
"        temperature: \"number\",\n"
"        condition: \"string\",\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    provider: async () => {\n"
"        const res = await fetch(\"https://api.weather.example.com/"
"current\")\n"
"        const data = await res.json()\n"
"        return {\n"
"            entries: [\n"
"                { temperature: data.temp, condition: data.description },\n"
"            ],\n"
"            reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 15 } },\n"
"        }\n"
"    },\n"
"\n"
"    render: (entry) =>\n"
"        VStack([\n"
"            Text(`${entry.temperature}°`, { font: \"title\" }),\n"
"            Text(entry.condition, { font: \"caption\" }),\n"
"        ]),\n"
"})\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:61
msgid "Authenticated Requests with Shared Storage"
msgstr "共有ストレージを伴う認証リクエスト"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:63
msgid ""
"Widgets run in a separate process and cannot access your app's memory. Use "
"`sharedStorage()` to read values that your app has written to a shared "
"container."
msgstr ""
"ウィジェットは別のプロセスで実行され、アプリのメモリにアクセスできません。ア"
"プリが共有コンテナに書き込んだ値を読むには `sharedStorage()` を使用します。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:65
msgid "iOS / watchOS: App Groups"
msgstr "iOS / watchOS: App Groups"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:67
msgid ""
"On Apple platforms, shared storage maps to `UserDefaults(suiteName:)` backed "
"by an App Group container. Set the `appGroup` field in your widget "
"declaration:"
msgstr ""
"Apple プラットフォームでは、共有ストレージは App Group コンテナに支えられた "
"`UserDefaults(suiteName:)` にマップされます。ウィジェット宣言で `appGroup` "
"フィールドを設定してください:"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:69
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"DashboardWidget\",\n"
"  displayName: \"Dashboard\",\n"
"  description: \"Account summary\",\n"
"  appGroup: \"group.com.example.shared\",\n"
"\n"
"  entryFields: {\n"
"    revenue: \"number\",\n"
"    users: \"number\",\n"
"  },\n"
"\n"
"  provider: async () => {\n"
"    const token = sharedStorage(\"auth_token\");\n"
"    const res = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/dashboard\", {\n"
"      headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` },\n"
"    });\n"
"    const data = await res.json();\n"
"    return {\n"
"      entries: [{ revenue: data.revenue, users: data.activeUsers }],\n"
"      reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 30 } },\n"
"    };\n"
"  },\n"
"\n"
"  render: (entry) =>\n"
"    VStack([\n"
"      Text(`$${entry.revenue}`, { font: \"title\" }),\n"
"      Text(`${entry.users} active users`, { font: \"caption\" }),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  kind: \"DashboardWidget\",\n"
"  displayName: \"Dashboard\",\n"
"  description: \"Account summary\",\n"
"  appGroup: \"group.com.example.shared\",\n"
"\n"
"  entryFields: {\n"
"    revenue: \"number\",\n"
"    users: \"number\",\n"
"  },\n"
"\n"
"  provider: async () => {\n"
"    const token = sharedStorage(\"auth_token\");\n"
"    const res = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/dashboard\", {\n"
"      headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${token}` },\n"
"    });\n"
"    const data = await res.json();\n"
"    return {\n"
"      entries: [{ revenue: data.revenue, users: data.activeUsers }],\n"
"      reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 30 } },\n"
"    };\n"
"  },\n"
"\n"
"  render: (entry) =>\n"
"    VStack([\n"
"      Text(`$${entry.revenue}`, { font: \"title\" }),\n"
"      Text(`${entry.users} active users`, { font: \"caption\" }),\n"
"    ]),\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:101
msgid "Your main app writes the token to the shared container:"
msgstr "メインアプリは共有コンテナにトークンを書き込みます:"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:103
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"import { preferencesSet } from \"perry/system\";\n"
"// In your app's login flow:\n"
"preferencesSet(\"auth_token\", token);\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"import { preferencesSet } from \"perry/system\";\n"
"// In your app's login flow:\n"
"preferencesSet(\"auth_token\", token);\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:109
msgid ""
"**Setup requirement (iOS):** Add an App Group capability in Xcode to both "
"the main app target and the widget extension target. The identifier must "
"match the `appGroup` value."
msgstr ""
"**セットアップ要件 (iOS):** メインアプリターゲットとウィジェット拡張ターゲッ"
"トの両方に Xcode で App Group ケイパビリティを追加してください。識別子は "
"`appGroup` の値と一致する必要があります。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:111
msgid "Android / Wear OS: SharedPreferences"
msgstr "Android / Wear OS: SharedPreferences"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:113
msgid ""
"On Android, shared storage maps to `SharedPreferences` with the name "
"`perry_shared`. The generated `Bridge.kt` reads values via "
"`context.getSharedPreferences(\"perry_shared\", MODE_PRIVATE)`."
msgstr ""
"Android では、共有ストレージは `perry_shared` という名前の "
"`SharedPreferences` にマップされます。生成された `Bridge.kt` は "
"`context.getSharedPreferences(\"perry_shared\", MODE_PRIVATE)` を介して値を読"
"み取ります。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:115
msgid "Reload Policies"
msgstr "リロードポリシー"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:117
msgid ""
"The `reloadPolicy` field controls when the system next calls your provider:"
msgstr ""
"`reloadPolicy`フィールドはシステムが次にプロバイダを呼び出すタイミングを制御"
"します:"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:126
msgid ""
"The refresh interval is read **at compile time**: the compiler scans the "
"provider's `return` statements for a literal `reloadPolicy: { after: "
"{ minutes: N } }` (where `N` is a numeric literal; fractional values round "
"to the nearest second) and bakes the interval into the generated platform "
"code. A `reloadPolicy` computed at runtime (a variable, a function call, …) "
"cannot be read — the compiler warns and the platform default applies."
msgstr ""
"リフレッシュ間隔が読み取られている **コンパイル時に**: コンパイラはプロバイダ"
"の `return` 文言を文字`reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: N } }` (where `N` "
"is a numeric literal; 微分値を最短秒に丸める) にスキャンし,生成されたプラット"
"フォームコードに区間を焼く. 実行時に計算された `reloadPolicy` (変数,関数呼び"
"出し, ...) は読み取れない.  コンパイラは警告し,プラットフォームデフォルトが適"
"用される."

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:136
msgid "`{ after: { minutes: N } }`"
msgstr "`{ after: { minutes: N } }`"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:136
msgid ""
"Re-fetch after N minutes. Compiles to "
"`.after(Date().addingTimeInterval(N*60))` on iOS/watchOS, "
"`android:updatePeriodMillis=\"N*60000\"` on Android, and "
"`setFreshnessIntervalMillis(N*60000)` on Wear OS."
msgstr ""
"N分後に再発します iOS/watchOSで "
"`.after(Date().addingTimeInterval(N*60))`,Androidで "
"`android:updatePeriodMillis=\"N*60000\"`,Wear OSで "
"`setFreshnessIntervalMillis(N*60000)`にコンパイルする."

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:137
msgid "_(omitted)_"
msgstr "_(省略)_"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:137
msgid ""
"Platform default: 30 minutes on iOS/watchOS, 30 minutes on Android, 60 "
"minutes on Wear OS."
msgstr ""
"プラットフォームデフォルト: iOS/watchOSで30分,Androidで30分,ウェアOSで60分."

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:139
msgid ""
"**Platform floors:** each platform ignores refresh requests below a minimum "
"interval, so the compiler clamps and warns:"
msgstr ""
"**プラットフォームの床:** 各プラットフォームは 最小の間隔以下のリフレッシュ要"
"求を無視するので コンパイラがクランプして警告します"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:142
msgid "Minimum (clamped)"
msgstr "最低値 (固定)"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:144
msgid "iOS / watchOS (WidgetKit)"
msgstr "iOS / watchOS (WidgetKit)"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:144 src/widgets/data-fetching.md:145
msgid "30 minutes"
msgstr "30分"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:144
msgid "15 minutes (refresh budget)"
msgstr "15分 (リフレッシュする予算)"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:145
msgid "Android (Glance, `updatePeriodMillis`)"
msgstr "Android (`updatePeriodMillis`の見方)"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:145
msgid "30 minutes (hard framework floor)"
msgstr "30分 (ハードフレームフロア)"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:146
msgid "Wear OS (Tiles freshness)"
msgstr "Wear OS (タイルの新鮮度)"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:146
msgid "60 minutes"
msgstr "60分"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:146
msgid "15 minutes"
msgstr "15分"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:148
msgid ""
"If different `return` statements carry different literal policies (e.g. a "
"short error-retry interval and a longer happy-path one), the smallest one "
"wins — the interval is a single compile-time constant per widget — and the "
"compiler emits a warning naming the value it chose."
msgstr ""
"異なる `return` 文言が異なる文字ポリシーを持っている場合 (e.g. 短いエラー再試"
"行間隔とより長いハッピーパス間隔),最小が勝利します. 間隔はウィジェットごとに"
"単一のコンパイル時間定数です. そしてコンパイラは選択した値を命名する警告を発"
"します."

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:153
msgid ""
"**Budget limits:** iOS restricts widget refreshes. Typical budget is 40--70 "
"refreshes per day. watchOS is stricter (see [watchOS Complications]"
"(watchos.md)). Request only what you need."
msgstr ""
"**予算制限:** iOS はウィジェットの更新を制限します。代表的な予算は 1 日あた"
"り 40〜70 回です。watchOS はより厳しいです（[watchOS Complications]"
"(watchos.md) を参照）。必要なものだけを要求してください。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:155
msgid "JSON Response Handling"
msgstr "JSONレスポンス処理"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:157
msgid ""
"The provider function receives the parsed JSON directly. Entry field types "
"must match your `entryFields` declaration:"
msgstr ""
"プロバイダ関数は解析済み JSON を直接受け取ります。エントリフィールドの型は "
"`entryFields` 宣言と一致する必要があります:"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:159
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"entryFields: {\n"
"  items: { type: \"array\", items: { type: \"object\", fields: { name: "
"\"string\", count: \"number\" } } },\n"
"  total: \"number\",\n"
"},\n"
"\n"
"provider: async () => {\n"
"  const res = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/items\");\n"
"  const data = await res.json();\n"
"  return {\n"
"    entries: [{\n"
"      items: data.results.map((r: any) => ({ name: r.name, count: "
"r.count })),\n"
"      total: data.total,\n"
"    }],\n"
"  };\n"
"},\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"entryFields: {\n"
"  items: { type: \"array\", items: { type: \"object\", fields: { name: "
"\"string\", count: \"number\" } } },\n"
"  total: \"number\",\n"
"},\n"
"\n"
"provider: async () => {\n"
"  const res = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/items\");\n"
"  const data = await res.json();\n"
"  return {\n"
"    entries: [{\n"
"      items: data.results.map((r: any) => ({ name: r.name, count: "
"r.count })),\n"
"      total: data.total,\n"
"    }],\n"
"  };\n"
"},\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:179
msgid ""
"If the fetch fails or JSON parsing throws, the widget extension falls back "
"to the placeholder data:"
msgstr ""
"fetchが失敗するかJSONパースがスローした場合、ウィジェット拡張機能はプレースホ"
"ルダデータにフォールバックします:"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:181
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  // ...\n"
"  placeholder: { temperature: 0, condition: \"Loading...\" },\n"
"\n"
"  provider: async () => {\n"
"    const res = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/weather\");\n"
"    if (!res.ok) {\n"
"      // Return stale/fallback data with a short retry interval\n"
"      return {\n"
"        entries: [{ temperature: 0, condition: \"Unavailable\" }],\n"
"        reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 5 } },\n"
"      };\n"
"    }\n"
"    const data = await res.json();\n"
"    return {\n"
"      entries: [{ temperature: data.temp, condition: data.desc }],\n"
"      reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 15 } },\n"
"    };\n"
"  },\n"
"});\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Widget({\n"
"  // ...\n"
"  placeholder: { temperature: 0, condition: \"Loading...\" },\n"
"\n"
"  provider: async () => {\n"
"    const res = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/weather\");\n"
"    if (!res.ok) {\n"
"      // Return stale/fallback data with a short retry interval\n"
"      return {\n"
"        entries: [{ temperature: 0, condition: \"Unavailable\" }],\n"
"        reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 5 } },\n"
"      };\n"
"    }\n"
"    const data = await res.json();\n"
"    return {\n"
"      entries: [{ temperature: data.temp, condition: data.desc }],\n"
"      reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 15 } },\n"
"    };\n"
"  },\n"
"});\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:204
msgid ""
"The `placeholder` field provides data shown in the widget gallery and during "
"loading. If the provider throws an unhandled exception, the generated Swift/"
"Kotlin code catches it and renders the placeholder instead."
msgstr ""
"`placeholder` フィールドは、ウィジェットギャラリーやロード中に表示されるデー"
"タを提供します。プロバイダが未処理の例外を投げた場合、生成された Swift/"
"Kotlin コードがそれをキャッチして代わりにプレースホルダーをレンダリングしま"
"す。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:206
msgid ""
"Note that with two distinct literal policies (5 and 15 minutes above), the "
"compiled widget uses the smaller one — 5 minutes, which the platform floor "
"then raises to its minimum (15 minutes on iOS) — and the compiler warns "
"about the choice. See [Reload Policies](#reload-policies)."
msgstr ""
"2つの異なるリテラルポリシー (上記5分と15分) で,コンパイルされたウィジェットが"
"小さいウィジェットを5分使用し,プラットフォームフロアがそれを最小値 (15分iOS) "
"に引き上げ,コンパイラが選択について警告することを注意してください. [再充電方"
"針](#reload-policies) を参照してください."

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:211
msgid "Multiple Timeline Entries"
msgstr "複数のタイムラインエントリ"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:213
msgid "Return multiple entries to schedule future content without re-fetching:"
msgstr ""
"再取得せずに将来のコンテンツをスケジュールするために複数のエントリを返します:"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:215
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"provider: async () => {\n"
"  const res = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/hourly\");\n"
"  const hours = await res.json();\n"
"  return {\n"
"    entries: hours.map((h: any) => ({\n"
"      temperature: h.temp,\n"
"      condition: h.condition,\n"
"    })),\n"
"    reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 60 } },\n"
"  };\n"
"},\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"provider: async () => {\n"
"  const res = await fetch(\"https://api.example.com/hourly\");\n"
"  const hours = await res.json();\n"
"  return {\n"
"    entries: hours.map((h: any) => ({\n"
"      temperature: h.temp,\n"
"      condition: h.condition,\n"
"    })),\n"
"    reloadPolicy: { after: { minutes: 60 } },\n"
"  };\n"
"},\n"
"```"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:229
msgid ""
"Each entry is rendered at the corresponding date in the timeline. The system "
"transitions between entries automatically."
msgstr ""
"各エントリはタイムライン上の対応する日時にレンダリングされます。システムはエ"
"ントリ間を自動的に遷移します。"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:233
msgid "[Configuration](configuration.md) -- User-configurable parameters"
msgstr "[設定](configuration.md) -- ユーザー設定可能なパラメータ"

#: src/widgets/data-fetching.md:234
msgid ""
"[Cross-Platform Reference](platforms.md) -- Build targets and platform "
"differences"
msgstr ""
"[クロスプラットフォームリファレンス](platforms.md) -- ビルドターゲットとプ"
"ラットフォームの違い"

#: src/widgets/platforms.md:3
msgid ""
"Perry widgets compile from a single TypeScript source to four platforms. The "
"same `Widget({...})` declaration produces native code for each target."
msgstr ""
"Perry のウィジェットは単一の TypeScript ソースから 4 つのプラットフォームにコ"
"ンパイルされます。同じ `Widget({...})` 宣言が各ターゲット用のネイティブコード"
"を生成します。"

#: src/widgets/platforms.md:5
msgid ""
"**Status:** this page has no TypeScript fences (only target-flag tables and "
"shell build commands), so the doc-tests harness has nothing to run here. The "
"`--target` flags listed below are wired in the compiler. Example files can "
"provide the required bundle id with the harness's `// widget-bundle-id:` "
"banner; end-to-end target coverage also requires the matching Xcode or "
"Android SDK on the CI host."
msgstr ""
"**状態:** このページには TypeScript フェンスはありません (ターゲットフラグ"
"テーブルとシェルビルドコマンドのみ) だから doc-tests はここでは実行できませ"
"ん. 下記の `--target` フラグはコンパイラに接続されています. 例ファイルは,ハー"
