#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:48
msgid ""
"Demand outran drain, the queue grew without bound, and the oldest entries — "
"the `main` runs, which are exactly the ones that gate nothing and therefore "
"nobody is watching — aged out."
msgstr ""
"古いエントリは  `main`が実行され, ゲートは何もないので 誰も見ていないもので"
"す."

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:52
msgid "What this is NOT"
msgstr "これは何ではない"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:54
msgid ""
"**It is not the concurrency bug, and it is not macOS runner availability.** "
"Both were the obvious reading, and both are wrong. Getting this right "
"matters, because each wrong reading has a \"fix\" that would make things "
"worse."
msgstr ""
"**macOS ランナー利用可能性ではありません** 両方とも間違いです 間違った解釈に"
"は 状況を悪化させる\"修正\"があるからです"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:58
msgid ""
"**Not the concurrency block — _as it stood in #7856_.** `gc-ratchet.yml`'s "
"`concurrency:` comment records two prior attempts (#7205): a shared group "
"with unconditional `cancel-in-progress` cancelled three consecutive `main` "
"runs, and scoping `cancel-in-progress` to pull requests did not fix it "
"either, because GitHub allows at most one _pending_ run per group. Keying "
"the group on `github.sha` for push events **did** fix cancellation. The "
"failure mode simply moved: runs stopped cancelling each other and started "
"queueing forever instead."
msgstr ""
"**#7856_であったように並行ブロックではありません.** `gc-ratchet.yml`の "
"`concurrency:` コメントは,以前の2回の試み (#7205) を記録している:無条件の "
"`cancel-in-progress` を共有したグループが連続して3回の `main` 実行をキャンセ"
"ルし,リクエストを引っ張る `cancel-in-progress` のスケープも修正できませんでし"
"た.GitHub はグループあたり最大で1回の _pending_ 実行を許可しているからです. "
"プッシュイベントのグループを `github.sha` にキー付けする **した** キャンセル"
"を修正する 失敗モードは単純に移動しました 実行が互いにキャンセルするのを止め "
"永遠に待機し始めました"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:66
msgid ""
"**⚠️ SUPERSEDED BY #7966 — this paragraph used to end \"Those blocks are "
"correct. Do not 'fix' them again.\" That sentence was true when written and "
"false three days later, and it is exactly the sentence that would send the "
"next reader past the real bug.**"
msgstr ""
"**この段落は\"そのブロックは正しい. この文は3日後に書かれた時に真実で 3日後に"
"誤りであり 次の読者に本当のバグを 忘れさせるような文です**"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:71
msgid ""
"The `github.sha` arm is guarded on `github.event_name == 'push'`. #7856 — "
"the change this very document describes — moved the main-line arm from "
"`push: branches: [main]` to `schedule:`. The guard stopped matching, the "
"expression fell through to `github.ref` (constant `refs/heads/main`), and "
"**\\#7205 came straight back on the arm \\#7856 created.** Measured "
"2026-08-12, identically on all ten gates: oldest run `queued` holding the "
"group, the next two `cancelled` with `jobs: 0`, newest `pending`. `gate-"
"freshness` itself was cancelled the same way."
msgstr ""
"`github.sha`アームは`github.event_name == 'push'`に保護されています. #7856 こ"
"のドキュメントが記述する変更は,メインラインアームを`push: branches: [main]`か"
"ら`schedule:`に移動しました. `github.ref` (恒定`refs/heads/main`) に落ちまし"
"た **\\#7205は \\#7856が作成した腕に直接戻りました** 2026年8月12日に測定され,"
"すべての10のゲートで同一です. グループを保持する最も古い実行 `queued`,次の2つ"
"の `cancelled` と `jobs: 0`,最新の `pending`. `gate-freshness`も同じ方法で"
"キャンセルされました"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:79
msgid ""
"Groups are now keyed on `github.run_id` for every non-pull-request event, "
"which is the only context value unconditionally distinct across scheduled "
"runs. `scripts/gc_gate_wiring_check.py` (in the required `lint` context) now "
"rejects a `schedule:` workflow whose concurrency group lacks "
"`github.run_id`, so this cannot relapse a fourth time silently."
msgstr ""
"グループが現在 `github.run_id` にキー付けされているのは,すべての非プルリクエ"
"スト イベントで,これはスケジュールされた実行で無条件に異なる唯一のコンテキス"
"ト値です. `scripts/gc_gate_wiring_check.py` (必要な `lint` 文脈では) は,同期"
"グループが `github.run_id` を欠いている `schedule:` ワークフローを拒絶してい"
"るため,これが4度目のサイレントな再発を起こすことはできません."

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:85
msgid ""
"**The lesson is about the sentence, not the YAML.** \"Do not fix this "
"again\" is a claim about the future, and a scheduling change three days "
"later invalidated it. A repaired invariant should be written down as an "
"_executable check_, not as an instruction to the next human to stop looking."
msgstr ""
"**このレッスンはYAMLではなく 文についてです** 3日後にスケジュールの変更で 無"
"効になったのです 修復された不変数は _実行可能なチェック_ として書き留められる"
"べきで 次の人間に 探すのを止めるよう指示されるべきではありません"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:90
msgid ""
"**Not macOS capacity.** This was the natural inference — the gates that went "
"dark are the macOS ones — but the job-level numbers refute it. At the moment "
"of measurement the queue held **45 `ubuntu-latest` jobs against 14 "
"`macos-14` jobs**, and `zizmor` (`ubuntu-latest`) was queued in the very "
"same second as `gc-ratchet` (`macos-14`). Ubuntu was starved harder in "
"absolute terms."
msgstr ""
"**macOS 容量ではありません** これは自然に推論されたものです 暗くなったゲート"
"は macOS のゲートですが 雇用レベルの数値はこれを否定しています 測定の瞬間に,"
"キューを保持 **45 `ubuntu-latest` の仕事に対して 14 `macos-14` の仕事"
"**`zizmor` (`ubuntu-latest`) は,`gc-ratchet` (`macos-14`) と同じ秒で列に並べ"
"られました. 絶対的に言えば ウンブーターはもっと飢えていました"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:96
msgid ""
"Two specific claims in #7856 do not survive checking, and are recorded here "
"so the next person does not re-derive them:"
msgstr ""
"7856号の2つの特定の主張はチェックに耐えられず,次の人がそれを再発しないように"
"ここに記録されています:"

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:99
msgid ""
"**`gc-root-dominance` does not run on `ubuntu-latest`.** It runs `macos-14`, "
"in two jobs. Its healthy-looking run count was pull-request runs, which "
"drain because they supersede each other; its `main` arm was queued like all "
"the others. The ubuntu-vs-macOS contrast that localised the problem to macOS "
"was comparing a PR arm against a `main` arm, not Linux against Darwin."
msgstr ""
"**`gc-root-dominance` は `ubuntu-latest` で実行されません.** `macos-14`を2つ"
"の作業で実行します 健康に見えたラン数はプル・リクエストランで,互いに置き換え"
"られるため,排水する. `main`の腕は他のすべてのように列に並んでいた. 問題を"
"macOSに局所化したUbuntu対macOSの対比は,PRアームと`main`アームを比較したもの"
"で,Linuxとダーウィンを比較したものではありません."

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:104
msgid ""
"**Moving `gc-ratchet` to Linux is not available as a remedy.** Its baseline "
"is captured under the `darwin-arm64` platform key and the checker _refuses_ "
"a platform mismatch rather than comparing numbers that are not comparable. "
"Moving it would turn the gate red, not relieve it. `tls-budget`'s macOS arm "
"is likewise irreducible: `_tlv_get_addr` is a Mach-O artefact and the "
"measurement does not exist elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"**`gc-ratchet` を Linux に移動する方法は利用できません.** そのベースラインは "
"`darwin-arm64` プラットフォームキーの下に記録され,チェックは比較できない数字"
"を比較するのではなく,プラットフォームの不一致を _refuses_ します. 移動すれば "
"ゲートが赤くなる `tls-budget`のmacOSアームは同様に縮小不能であ"
"る:`_tlv_get_addr`はマッハ・オ・アーテファクトであり,測定は他の場所には存在し"
"ない."

#: src/testing/ci-gate-scheduling.md:111
msgid ""
"The consequence of both corrections is the same: **rebalancing pools cannot "
"help.** Only reducing total job demand can. That is what this change does."
msgstr ""
"両方の訂正の結果は同じです **リバランスプールは役に立たない.** 雇用の総需要を"
"減らすことしかできないのです この変化がもたらすのはそれです"

