#: src/cli/flags.md:97
msgid "`--asset-module <specifier=dir>`"
msgstr "`--asset-module <specifier=dir>`"

#: src/cli/flags.md:97
msgid ""
"Generate a virtual module whose default export maps every file below `dir` "
