#: src/internals/gc-rooting-invariant.md:261
msgid ""
"**A real symbol codegen never emits.** The set carried "
"`js_object_get_field_by_name` next to `js_object_set_field_by_name`, which "
"reads as symmetric coverage of property access. It is not: codegen emits the "
"SET verbatim but lowers every GET to `js_object_get_field_by_name_f64`, "
"`js_object_get_field_ic_miss` or "
"`js_typed_feedback_object_get_field_by_name_f64`, none of which were in the "
"set. Property sets classified `MOVING: YES`, property gets classified "
"`MOVING: no`, and 31 `--stale-registers` hits on the gate corpus were "
"dropped by `--moving-only` as a result — including the shape that faults "
"deterministically under `PERRY_GC_PROTECT_FROMSPACE=1  "
"PERRY_GC_PROTECT_FROMSPACE_DEPTH=800` at zod's `clone`. The protector and "
"the checker disagreed; the checker was wrong."
msgstr ""
"**真のシンボルのコードゲンは 決して発信しない** `js_object_set_field_by_name`"
"の隣に `js_object_get_field_by_name`が載っていました これは物件へのアクセスを"
"対称的にカバーするものです 違う: codegen は文字どおりの SET を発信しますが,す"
"べての GET を "
"`js_object_get_field_by_name_f64`,`js_object_get_field_ic_miss`,または "
"`js_typed_feedback_object_get_field_by_name_f64` に下げます. `MOVING: YES` と"
"分類されたプロパティセット,`MOVING: no` と分類されたプロパティセット,ゲート"
"コープスの 31 `--stale-registers` のヒットが `--moving-only` によって削除さ"
"れ,結果として,Zod の `clone` で `PERRY_GC_PROTECT_FROMSPACE=1  "
"PERRY_GC_PROTECT_FROMSPACE_DEPTH=800` に決定的に誤った形状を含む. 守護者と"
"チェックは違いました チェックは間違っていました"

